WEBVTT

00:08:56.668 --> 00:09:00.917
that a child and then later an adult
sort of acquires over time.

00:09:00.941 --> 00:09:03.953
But, I'm thinking a lot about
the internal experience:

00:09:03.977 --> 00:09:05.194
What are you feeling?

00:09:05.218 --> 00:09:08.443
How joyful do you feel to be entering
into this gathering of people,

00:09:08.467 --> 00:09:10.306
or how nervous do you feel?

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:13.463
CA: Right. So, you were
both shy and introverted --

00:09:13.487 --> 00:09:14.658
SC: Yes.

00:09:14.682 --> 00:09:18.140
CA: And by the way, I was as well
as a kid. I felt both intensely.

00:09:18.164 --> 00:09:23.017
The first day at a new school
was so stressful, so hard.

00:09:23.041 --> 00:09:25.845
I could hardly cope with that.

00:09:25.869 --> 00:09:28.525
SC: And how long did it take you
to feel comfortable?

00:09:28.549 --> 00:09:30.704
CA: In some ways, I never did.